==Battleground==
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3~12 seconds<sup>90f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[Two Can]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Tackey]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since Tackey is in the stage, it is recommended to use mostly melee or midrange Units. [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rares]] such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]] make for decent damage options. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] can be used to block Two Can's Waves, and with curse immunity talent, can tank Lowkey's attacks.

